# --- Scaled performance-test data (regenerate with Python/scale_dataset.py) ---
Data/Scaled/
*_1m.csv
*_5m.csv

# --- Credentials: never commit ---
.env
*.env
config.local.*
**/credentials.json

# --- Power BI working files ---
# PBIP local state. These are per-machine or per-refresh artefacts, not project
# definition. cache.abf in particular holds the compressed model data and would
# churn on every refresh. editorSettings.json IS tracked: it carries project
# behaviour such as autodetectRelationships.
*.pbix.bak
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/cache.abf
**/.pbi/unappliedChanges.json

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/

# --- OS / editor ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/settings.json

# --- Cached Microsoft PBIR JSON schemas ---
# Downloaded from developer.microsoft.com for offline schema validation during
# report generation. Committed so generation is reproducible without network.

# Scratch renders used to eyeball the report. Not part of the project.
_review/
